KONOHAGAKURE — CIVILIAN VENDOR PERMIT

Permit holder: Ichiraku Ramen (proprietor: Teuchi)
Location: Market district, Hidden Leaf Village
Permit class: Food service — prepared meals (ramen)

Terms:
- The vendor is licensed to operate within the village commercial district under the Konoha civilian commerce ordinance.
- The vendor agrees to serve active-duty shinobi and to observe village curfew and sanitation standards.
- Village emergency measures (lockdown, evacuation) supersede normal operating hours.

This permit is issued by the Konoha civilian licensing office and is renewable annually. Vendors serving the shinobi corps in good standing are recognized as valued members of the village community.
Filed by the Administration Building, Civilian Affairs.
